pmc:ChristianTheosophyAugenblickKreaturlosenFuehrtHoerenGottes a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Momentary creatureless absorption yields hearing God"@en, "Augenblick im Kreaturlosen führt zum Hören Gottes"@de ;
    skos:definition "Throwing oneself for a moment into the creatureless place yields hearing what God speaks."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:ChristianTheosophyAugenblickKreaturlosenOrt ;
