pmp:ChristianTheosophyStundeSchweigenWollenSinnen a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "One hour of silence from willing and thinking"@en, "Eine Stunde Schweigen von Wollen und Sinnen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Steps: (1) cease all wanting; (2) cease all mental activity of the senses/thought; (3) hold this for an hour."@en ;
    skos:note "German: one hour (\"eine Stunde\"); the 1894 English says \"for a while\"."@en ;
    skos:note "Term as printed: schweigen von allem Wollen und Sinnen."@en ;
