pmc:ChristianTheosophyEigenesHoerenWollenSehenVerhindert a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Own hearing, willing, seeing block divine perception"@en, "Eigenes Hören, Wollen, Sehen verhindert die Gottesschau"@de ;
    skos:definition "One's own hearing, willing and seeing are what prevent seeing and hearing God."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a condition of failure; it concerns pmc:ChristianTheosophyUebersinnlichesLebenGottSehenReden, pmc:ChristianTheosophyEwigesHoerenSehenSprechenOffenbart."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
