pmc:ChristianTheosophyWilleKreaturenBrichtChristusAb a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Will entering creatures breaks one off from Christ"@en, "Wille in den Kreaturen bricht von Christus ab"@de ;
    skos:definition "If the will goes into creatures, one has broken oneself off from Christ (his word and spirit)."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a condition of failure; it concerns pmc:ChristianTheosophyInnewohnendenHeiligenGeistBewahren."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChristianTheosophy ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VomUebersinnlichenLeben ;
    dcterms:source "Böhme, Vom übersinnlichen Leben, the sixth booklet of Der Weg zu Christo, verfasset in neun Büchlein (no place, printed after the Amsterdam copy, 1732), p. 168, §11; read in a full-text layer of the open scan archive item derwegzuchristov00bohm whose running heads carry the page" .

pmp:ChristianTheosophyGelasseneDemutImmerwaehrendeBusse a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Resigned humility and perpetual repentance"@en, "Gelassene Demut und immerwährende Buße"@de ;
    skos:definition "Remain constantly in resigned humility and give oneself to unceasing, perpetual repentance, always regretting that creatures live in one."@en ;
    skos:note "Term as printed: gelassene Demuth; immerwährende stäte Busse."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChristianTheosophy ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VomUebersinnlichenLeben ;
    dcterms:source "Böhme, Vom übersinnlichen Leben, the sixth booklet of Der Weg zu Christo, verfasset in neun Büchlein (no place, printed after the Amsterdam copy, 1732), p. 168, §11; read in a full-text layer of the open scan archive item derwegzuchristov00bohm whose running heads carry the page" .

pmc:ChristianTheosophyDemutBusseBewahrenGeist a pm:Presupposing ;
    rdfs:label "Only humility and repentance guard the Spirit"@en, "Nur Demut und Buße bewahren den Geist"@de ;
    skos:definition "Once the will has gone into creatures, the only way to guard oneself (keep the Spirit) is constant resigned humility and perpetual repentance."@en ;
    pm:priorStep pmp:ChristianTheosophyGelasseneDemutImmerwaehrendeBusse ;
    pm:dependentStep pmc:ChristianTheosophyInnewohnendenHeiligenGeistBewahren ;
    pm:prerequisiteStrength pm:statedNecessity ;
    pm:consequenceOfSkipping "Otherwise one cannot guard oneself (\"anderst nicht verwahren\")." ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChristianTheosophy ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VomUebersinnlichenLeben ;
    dcterms:source "Böhme, Vom übersinnlichen Leben, the sixth booklet of Der Weg zu Christo, verfasset in neun Büchlein (no place, printed after the Amsterdam copy, 1732), p. 168, §11; read in a full-text layer of the open scan archive item derwegzuchristov00bohm whose running heads carry the page" .

pmc:ChristianTheosophyTaeglichesSterbenKreaturenTaeglicheHimmelfahrt a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Daily dying of creatures, daily ascension of the will"@en, "Tägliches Sterben der Kreaturen, tägliche Himmelfahrt des Willens"@de ;
    skos:definition "Standing in daily dying of the creatures and daily ascension to heaven according to the will."@en ;
    skos:note "Term as printed: tägliche Himmelfahrt."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChristianTheosophy ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VomUebersinnlichenLeben ;
    dcterms:source "Böhme, Vom übersinnlichen Leben, the sixth booklet of Der Weg zu Christo, verfasset in neun Büchlein (no place, printed after the Amsterdam copy, 1732), p. 168, §11; read in a full-text layer of the open scan archive item derwegzuchristov00bohm whose running heads carry the page" .

pmc:ChristianTheosophyBusseFuehrtTaeglichemSterbenHimmelfahrt a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Repentance yields daily dying and ascension"@en, "Buße führt zu täglichem Sterben und Himmelfahrt"@de ;
    skos:definition "Perpetual repentance in resigned humility yields daily dying of the creatures and daily ascension in the will."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:ChristianTheosophyGelasseneDemutImmerwaehrendeBusse ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:ChristianTheosophyTaeglichesSterbenKreaturenTaeglicheHimmelfahrt ;
