    rdfs:label "Hourly surrender yields power over sin and temptation"@en, "Stündliche Ergebung führt zu Kraft über Sünde und Anfechtung"@de ;
    skos:definition "Hourly self-surrender into God's mercy and Christ's suffering yields power over sin, death, devil, hell and world and steadfastness in temptation."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:ChristianTheosophyStuendlichesEinschwingenGottesBarmherzigkeitChristi ;
