    rdfs:label "Sign: clothed in the radiance of divine glory"@en, "Zeichen: vom Glanz göttlicher Herrlichkeit überkleidet"@de ;
    skos:definition "Announced sign: the will would be clothed over with the highest radiance of God's glory."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a sign of success, announced in advance, of pmp:ChristianTheosophyStuendigerAbbruchWillensKreaturen."@en ;
