pmc:ChristianTheosophyZeichenChristiLiebeSchmeckenUnaussprechliche a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Sign: tasting Christ's love, perceiving unspeakable words"@en, "Zeichen: Christi Liebe schmecken, unaussprechliche Worte empfinden"@de ;
    skos:definition "Announced sign: one would taste within the sweetest love of Christ that no one can utter and feel within the unspeakable words of the Lord about his mercy."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a sign of success, announced in advance, of pmp:ChristianTheosophyStuendigerAbbruchWillensKreaturen."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChristianTheosophy ;
