pmc:ChristianTheosophyZeichenKreuzSanftemWohltun a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Sign: the cross turned into gentle benefit"@en, "Zeichen: das Kreuz wird zu sanftem Wohltun"@de ;
    skos:definition "Announced sign: one would feel the cross of Christ turned into a gentle benefit and come to love it more than the world's honour and goods."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a sign of success, announced in advance, of pmp:ChristianTheosophyStuendigerAbbruchWillensKreaturen."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChristianTheosophy ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VomUebersinnlichenLeben ;
