pmc:ChristianTheosophyStuendigerAbbruchFuehrtEmpfindenGoettlicher a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Hour-long break yields perceiving divine words"@en, "Stündiger Abbruch führt zum Empfinden göttlicher Worte"@de ;
    skos:definition "Breaking the will off from all creatures for an hour yields (among other signs) perceiving the unspeakable words of the Lord, i.e. divine hearing."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:ChristianTheosophyStuendigerAbbruchWillensKreaturen ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:ChristianTheosophyUebersinnlichesLebenGottSehenReden ;
