pmc:ChristianTheosophyZeichenLeibFolgtChristusStirbt a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Sign: body follows Christ, dying outwardly and inwardly"@en, "Zeichen: Leib folgt Christus, stirbt außen und innen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Announced sign for the body: it would be drawn into the following of Christ and begin to die outwardly (to worldly vanity and evil deeds, becoming averse to luxury) and inwardly (to evil lust and inclination), gaining a wholly new mind and will always directed to God."@en ;
    skos:note "Verb of drawing garbled in OCR (\"en werden\")."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a sign of success, announced in advance, of pmp:ChristianTheosophyStuendigerAbbruchWillensKreaturen."@en ;
