pmc:ChristianTheosophyZeichenFreudeChristusaehnlichkeitTrotzHass a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Sign: rejoicing in likeness to Christ despite hatred"@en, "Zeichen: Freude über Christusähnlichkeit trotz Hass"@de ;
    skos:definition "Announced sign: he will not take the world's hatred as injury but rejoice at being made worthy to resemble Christ's image, gladly bearing the cross if only Christ pours his sweetest love into him."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a sign of success, announced in advance."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChristianTheosophy ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VomUebersinnlichenLeben ;
    dcterms:source "Böhme, Vom übersinnlichen Leben, the sixth booklet of Der Weg zu Christo, verfasset in neun Büchlein (no place, printed after the Amsterdam copy, 1732), p. 170, §17; read in a full-text layer of the open scan archive item derwegzuchristov00bohm whose running heads carry the page" .

pmc:ChristianTheosophyAngriffInnerenZornAeussereWelt a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Assault by inner wrath and outer world"@en, "Angriff durch inneren Zorn und äußere Welt"@de ;
    skos:definition "Danger: God's wrath assailing from within and the evil world from without, as with Christ."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmp:ChristianTheosophyStuendigerAbbruchWillensKreaturen ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChristianTheosophy ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VomUebersinnlichenLeben ;
