pmc:ChristianTheosophyNeueWeltSehenGottesZorn a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Seeing a new world within, through God's wrath"@en, "Eine neue Welt in sich sehen, durch Gottes Zorn hindurch"@de ;
    skos:definition "Under inner wrath and outer mockery, pressing inwardly into God's great love, refreshed and upheld by the name JESUS, seeing and feeling within a new world that penetrates through God's wrath; wrapping the soul in it and regarding everything alike, wherever the body may find itself, hellish or earthly."@en ;
    skos:note "Term as printed: neue Welt."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChristianTheosophy ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VomUebersinnlichenLeben ;
    dcterms:source "Böhme, Vom übersinnlichen Leben, the sixth booklet of Der Weg zu Christo, verfasset in neun Büchlein (no place, printed after the Amsterdam copy, 1732), p. 170, §18; read in a full-text layer of the open scan archive item derwegzuchristov00bohm whose running heads carry the page" .

pmp:ChristianTheosophyAnfechtungSeeleVaterBefehlen a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Commending the soul to the Father under assault"@en, "In der Anfechtung die Seele dem Vater befehlen"@de ;
    skos:definition "In assault, do as Christ did: commend one's soul to the Father and press, out of the world's mockery and anguish, inward into God's great love, invoking the name JESUS."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChristianTheosophy ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VomUebersinnlichenLeben ;
    dcterms:source "Böhme, Vom übersinnlichen Leben, the sixth booklet of Der Weg zu Christo, verfasset in neun Büchlein (no place, printed after the Amsterdam copy, 1732), p. 170, §18; read in a full-text layer of the open scan archive item derwegzuchristov00bohm whose running heads carry the page" .

pmc:ChristianTheosophyEindringenGottesLiebeFuehrtInneren a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Pressing into God's love yields the inner new world"@en, "Eindringen in Gottes Liebe führt zur inneren neuen Welt"@de ;
    skos:definition "Pressing inward into God's love under assault, through the name JESUS, yields seeing and feeling the new world within."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:ChristianTheosophyAnfechtungSeeleVaterBefehlen ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:ChristianTheosophyNeueWeltSehenGottesZorn ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
