pmc:ChristianTheosophyScheinbarAusbleibendeVersorgungProbe a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Apparent lack of provision is a trial"@en, "Scheinbar ausbleibende Versorgung ist eine Probe"@de ;
    skos:definition "Do not misread apparent withdrawal of God's blessing in material need: if it seems God will not provide, it is only a trial (Proba) and a pull to pray more and commend all one's ways to him."@en ;
    skos:note "Paragraph number misread as \"1.\" in OCR (sequence gives 19); continues to p. 171."@en ;
    skos:note "Term as printed: Proba und Zug."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmp:ChristianTheosophyStuendigerAbbruchWillensKreaturen ;
