pmp:ChristianTheosophyKreaturenNichtsAusgehen a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Going out from all creatures into nothingness"@en, "Aus allen Kreaturen ins Nichts ausgehen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Go out from all creatures and become a nothing to all nature and creature."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:ChristianTheosophy ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:VomUebersinnlichenLeben ;
    dcterms:source "Böhme, Vom übersinnlichen Leben, the sixth booklet of Der Weg zu Christo, verfasset in neun Büchlein (no place, printed after the Amsterdam copy, 1732), p. 173, §27; read in a full-text layer of the open scan archive item derwegzuchristov00bohm whose running heads carry the page" .

pmc:ChristianTheosophyNichtsFuehrtEwige a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Becoming nothing yields being in the eternal One"@en, "Zu Nichts werden führt ins ewige Eine"@de ;
    skos:definition "Going out from all creatures and becoming nothing to them yields being in the eternal One and feeling love's highest virtue."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:ChristianTheosophyKreaturenNichtsAusgehen ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:ChristianTheosophyEwigen ;
